 Introduction
 ------------

 TopTech is a simple top-list generator for TechnoBBS.

 Usage: TopTech <entries> <min. access level> <max. access level> <type>

 <type>  0: Message Writers
         1: Uploaders (files)
         2: Downloaders (files)
         3: Uploaders (bytes)
         4: Downloaders (bytes)
         5: Callers

 Example: TopTech 10 1 255 5 >T:TopTen_Callers.txt


 Warning
 -------

 TopTech reads user files directly, so TechCon can fail to read something
 when TopTech is running. This is not very likely at all, but possible.


